    justification:  # 9c4e
    description: "Hack (hack.py:89) and Smithy (smithy.py:62) emit stable_id as '{lang}:{path}:{kind}:{name}' while the other 25 location-based analyzers use '{lang}:{path}:{name}:{kind}'. If these location-based IDs are ever used for cross-analyzer comparison, the inconsistent format would cause silent mismatches. Fix: align to majority format '{lang}:{path}:{name}:{kind}'. See ADR-0014 Phase 0."  # 9c4e
